# The Erie Canal ("Low Bridge, Everybody Down"): Thomas S. Allen (written 1905, published 1913).
# Words as printed in Sandburg, The American Songbag (1927), "The Erie Canal" ("fifteen miles";
# Allen's 1913 sheet has "fifteen years").
